  <Document>
    <name>eSAKAY Route 1 | October 2022 geographic references</name>
    <open>1</open>
    <description>The six names come from the 3 October 2022 sheet. Toggle either line to inspect overlapping sections. Each placemark identifies its geographic source. Boarding locations, permitted passenger use and current service require separate evidence.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;a href="https://meralcomain.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/2019-02/fy_2018_results_briefing_reports.pdf"&gt;2019 Meralco launch briefing&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href="https://earth.google.com/web/@14.566831,121.0376601,0a,1100d,35y,0h,0t,0r/data=ChYqEAgBEgoyMDIyLTA3LTMwGAFCAggBOgMKATBCAggASg0I____________ARAA"&gt;Google Earth historical view of Estrella–Pantaleon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Route geometry and OSM landmarks © OpenStreetMap contributors, &lt;a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"&gt;ODbL 1.0&lt;/a&gt;. The Tivoli property point is from DMCI Homes.</description>
