      <Placemark>
        <name>Outbound · Buendia to Maysilo</name>
        <description>Via Zodiac, Jupiter and Rockwell, past the Estrella approach, then across the Makati–Mandaluyong Bridge. &lt;a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/9236380/history/45"&gt;Directional OpenStreetMap record, 2 September 2022&lt;/a&gt;. The relation contains road ways only.</description>
