      <Placemark>
        <name>Return · Maysilo toward Buendia</name>
        <description>Separate return record via the Makati–Mandaluyong Bridge. Two adjacent Boni ways were joined in connected order. The record reaches Zodiac then retraces Jupiter and ends away from the junction. &lt;a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/11611024/history/12"&gt;Directional OpenStreetMap record, 2 September 2022&lt;/a&gt;. The relation contains road ways only.</description>
